__pycache__/
*.pyc
main.py
.venv/
.DS_Store

# Raw inputs live on storage and are not distributed with the repository; processed
# data is regenerable from them. Two exceptions are tracked, both small primary
# sources rather than pipeline outputs, and both things the repo cannot function
# without: the site shapefile, and the constraint observations. The constraint
# files are held in the repository rather than symlinked because the upstream
# copies are edited and moved in place; see data/raw/constraints/provenance.md.
data/raw/*
!data/raw/sites/
!data/raw/constraints/
!data/raw/initial_conditions/
# Un-ignoring the directory un-ignores everything in it; the inputs that
# still live on storage and are symlinked in are excluded again here. The
# initial conditions are tracked as one converted file; the producer's
# 800,000-file tree it was made from is the SCC-only files/ symlink.
data/raw/constraints/nee
data/raw/constraints/sda_8k_site_rdata
data/raw/initial_conditions/files
data/processed/

.claude/worktrees/
